OL,3,ANew wave of bomb threats hit European
OL,4,Aairlines
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe disruption comes after nearly 30
OL,7,Faircraft and several airports across
OL,8,FEurope were impacted by threats earlier
OL,9,Fthis week, in what the UK called a
OL,10,F"malicious hoax".
